# Changelog
## [0.3.0] - 2026-08-16
### Breaking changes
 - Rename netfilter enums and add non_exhaustive to enum. (c39b553)
 - Flatten subsystem public API. (bfebd24)
 - Use zerocopy for buffer parsing. (e49a355)
 - Removed all public constants. (cf56cca)
 - Use enums for subsystem and message types. (7f6be02)

### New features
 - Add bindings of NfTables subsystem. (21ffeff, 95ac829)
 - conntrack new message type. (591a4b2)
 - conntrack delete message type and attributes. (5da788e)
 - feat: conntrack get netlink netfilter message types. (c8e49d2)

### Bug fixes
 - Skip tests on big-endian platforms. (4f11cfc)

## [0.2.0] - 2023-07-10
### Breaking changes
 - Removed reexport on `nl`, please use `netlink_packet_core`. (a7bfcfd)
 - Removed reexport on `utils`, please use `netlink_packet_utils`. (a7bfcfd)

### New features
 - N/A

### Bug fixes
